  "final_version": {
    "version": "R170 第 4 轮方案 \"双手捧果在胸前 + 低头张嘴咬一口\" 的最终版 (2026-10-22 18:13-18:14 烘焙, 已冻结)",
    "frozen": true,
    "note": "素材已冻结: assets/character_R156/eat_fruit_0..4.png 与 81_R170_eat_fruit_bake.py 的当前状态互相一致 (重跑脚本会复现同一批帧), 不再迭代。",
    "verifier": "83_R170_scene_verify.py → 13/13 PASS (E1/E2/E3/E4/E5/E6/E7/E8/E9/E10 + W1/W2/W3)",
    "dist_to_mouth_box_px_sequence": [
